Unfortunately, no one has 
any ideas for a treatment.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:03.100
Fortunately, there is no 
pain in this illness.

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:07.960
Death arrives during sleep, and they 
will simply never wake up again.

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:11.180
It may be the most peaceful 
death you could ask for.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.760
Itsuki,

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:18.520
do you know why Yuzuha always 
keeps the coffin with her?

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.520
She said it makes her feel safe...

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:25.420
She doesn't want to cause anyone 
trouble when her life ends.

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:29.780
I believe it represents 
her mental preparation.

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:36.790
I'm sure Yuzuha doesn't want to be 
around people for the same reason.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.420
How can this happen?

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:41.540
Yuzuha hasn't done anything to deserve this.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:42.340
Why...

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:47.900
Itsuki, please give her your support.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:53.230
I don't think Yuzuha has 
given up on life yet.

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:57.820
I'm sure your presence would give her hope.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.800
What are you doing?

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.900
You're back, Itsuki.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.630
I'm sorry about earlier...

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.240
It's all right. What are you doing, anyway?

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.830
I'm making a coffin as an apology.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.750
You can put this beside her coffin,

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.020
and it would be a double coffin 
instead of a double bed!

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:18.110
You can make up with her usingー

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:19.610
Good work, Mana!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.910
Yuzuha, Yuzuha!

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:23.930
You're in there, right?

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:25.540
Open the door, please!

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:32.810
Yuzuha, if you don't open it, I'll have to break
down this door. Are you fine with thatー

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:33.950
Don't do that.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:36.430
Yuzuha, let's go outside, now!

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:39.850
I'm sorry, I can't go with youー

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:42.180
Take a look at this!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.240
It's Kanda-san, the coffin!

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:46.190
Your Katrine's friend!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.320
Of course, I bought lunch packs, too!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.500
Don't worry. If you can't paint 
because you can't dream,

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:55.070
then see it with me instead!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:58.070
I'll show you the beautiful outdoors!

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:00.920
I want to see it with you.

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:04.410
I'll hold you, even if you fall down.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.890
I want to spend the same time with you.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.460
Onii-chan...

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.920
Come on, let's go.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:11.960
Okay.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:26.020
It's still bright, so maybe I can't see.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.740
I was wondering where my 
constellation would be.

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.480
Your constellation is Pisces, right?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.190
Yes.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:36.460
It is the faintest constellation
 in the zodiac.

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:38.400
That is Yuzuha.

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:43.070
The shape is uneven, 
and it just doesn't stand out.

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:46.040
Being bright and standing 
out doesn't make things better.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:46.970
Right?

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:50.970
Being bright and standing 
out isn't me, either.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:54.140
But why is a constellation without 
a single third magnitude star

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:56.880
considered to be part of the zodiac?

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.900
Pisces has to be a piece of it, right?

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:02.920
Wow, I wasn't expecting that.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.520
You're full of sur<i>pisces</i>!

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:11.950
I'm sure it's because someone found it.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:15.130
Someone found it in the big sky?

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:15.780
Yeah.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:21.310
Right, there's someone who can find 
it even if it doesn't stand out.

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:23.280
Thank you, onii-chan.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:30.470
Maybe half of onii-chan is 
made of pure kindness...

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:36.170
I'm feeling... sleepy...

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.180
Don't worry. Sleep.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.090
Is this a dream?

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.940
It feels so gentle and warm.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.100
It makes me feel so safe.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:00.320
What? You had a dream?

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.990
It was a big sur<i>pisce</i> for me!

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.520
I'm Pisces, after all!

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:09.020
Hey, onii-chan.

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:13.050
You said you don't need anything in return,

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.460
but I want to give you something.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.460
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:23.600
No, I think I can fulfill my 
duty as maiden if it's with you.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:26.920
It's not because it's my job, 
or because I've given up on living.

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:29.100
I really want toー

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.720
Are you really okay with it?

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.540
You'll have my child?

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.610
Yes.

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:38.480
Master Pervert Baron, 
your novels were right!

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:42.360
Onii-chan...

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:46.680
Don't worry. Follow my lead.

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:52.860
Please be gentle.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:10.200
Mango, fig, cherries, all ripe for picking!

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.600
What is that song?

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:15.360
It's the Erotica Fruits Song 
written by Prince Dandy!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:18.220
Sing with me and awaken your virility!

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:19.980
Whatever happened to something-master?

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:23.080
I finished reading all of 
Master Pervert Baron's novels.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:27.720
The next master is super 
erotica musician Prince Dandy!

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:31.160
I also prepared this for you.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.420
A present? For me?

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:36.380
Why would I give you a present? It's for Arie!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.560
Take this and rush to Arie's side!

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:40.420
Have an erotica fruits parade!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:44.430
Mango, fig, cherries, all ripe for picking!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:45.910
Arie?

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.500
I guess she's not here today.

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:50.430
Arie!

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:55.900
I never knew there was a room there.

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:00.540
Anyway, I hear... that you 
have done it with Yuzuha...

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.440
without any issue.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.450
Yeah, all thanks to you.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:06.100
I didn't do anything.

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:08.670
Could that be for me?

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.700
Well, this is...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:11.610
Here you go.

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:13.200
Wow, great!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.810
Thank you very much.

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:17.920
Yeah. You gave me some great advice.

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.940
<i>Oh. I forgot to check what was inside.</i>

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:22.010
<i>Is this going to be all right?</i>

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:23.170
Wow!

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.170
So many! Wonderful!

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:27.580
I'm impressed, Itsuki-san.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:31.750
You understand my tastes so well.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:36.490
Is this the role-play from the OP?

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:37.690
More!

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:42.120
Who would've thought Arie
 would enjoy it so much?!

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:45.370
Mana, are you sure you wanted 
me to tie you up here?

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:46.670
Yes, it's fine.

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:48.480
This is getting interesting!

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:50.700
Sing with me, Mahiru!

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:53.690
You too, pervert in front of the TV!

00:21:53.690 --> 00:21:59.240
Mango, fig, cherries, all ripe for picking!

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:59.920
<b>Please Have My Child!</b>

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:39.930
I've Got So Many Kids

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:39.540
Naginata?
